.TH "PACSCRIPTS" "8" "2025\-12\-11" "Pacman\-contrib 1\&.13\&.1" "Pacman\-contrib Manual"
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
.\" * Define some portability stuff
.\" -----------------------------------------------------------------
